<BRK/>
<OLI>Piping details;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Burner control schematics;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Flame safety schematics;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Component details; and</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Throat tile details.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL><SUB>Stacks, Dampers, and Breechings</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Include the following:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>General arrangement;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Breeching, reinforcing details;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Breeching hangers and support details;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Dampers and operators;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Access doors and frames;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Expansion joints; and</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Stack details including anchor bolt and foundation details, stack sampling ports, platforms, and accessories.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL><SUB>Coal Handling Equipment</SUB> Drawings</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Include the following:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Certified outline and general arrangement drawings for complete coal handling system;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Dimensional equipment and fabrication drawings, including equipment weights, equipment locations, support details, and anchor bolt arrangements 
for items and equipment specified under the paragraph COAL HANDLING EQUIPMENT;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Control panel, coal presence indicators, and equipment response switch details; and</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Control schematic diagrams and complete wiring diagrams.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL><SUB>Fuel Oil Equipment</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Manufacturer's standard size for pumps, pump curves, valves, strainers and pump wiring and include the following:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Certified outline and general arrangement drawings;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Certified pump curves;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Equipment detail sheets including viscosity controller, heater and valves;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Electrical wiring diagrams; and</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Oil tanks, foundations, tank heaters, appurtenances, water drawoff and level indication.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL><SUB>Piping and Specialty Items</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Manufacturer's standard size and include the following:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Details of valves and fittings;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Feedwater regulator details and schematics;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Details and schematics of feedwater automatic recirculation; and</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Installation details for ball expansion joints for saturated steam piping including allowable angular flex and minimum offset dimensions.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Furnishing Approved Drawings</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Furnish one reproducible mylar shop drawing of each approved drawing sheet to the Contracting Officer for the following items:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Boiler layout, foundations, construction and details including economizers, and auxiliaries;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Breeching layout, construction and details;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Burner control and flame safety schematics;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Burner details;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Wiring diagrams;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Fuel tanks, foundations and appurtenances;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Feedwater automatic recirculation system;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Piping schematics;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Control diagram schematics including control panel construction and layouts;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Coal handling system;</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Stoker details; and</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Ash handling system.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT><SPT><TTL><SUB>Posted Operating Instructions</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide posted operating instructions for each piece of equipment installed.</TXT><BRK/>
