<BRK/>
<TXT>Welded construction of not less than<MET> 6 mm</MET><ENG> 1/4 inch</ENG> thick [410 stainless steel] [structurally reinforced steel plate lined with 8 gage (<MET> 4.18 mm</MET><ENG>
 0.1644 inch</ENG>) 410 stainless steel] plate not less than<MET> 4.50 meters wide and 8.50 meters long</MET><ENG> 14 feet wide and 28 feet long</ENG>.  Side slopes not less 
than 60 degrees from horizontal.  Interior bolts shall have flat heads.  Support hopper from concrete pit walls as indicated.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Track Girders</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Two wide flanged beams designed for Cooper's E-[_____] loading with 50 percent impact allowance and sized at W [_____] by [_____].  Provide beams 
